#: src/features/homepage/faq.tsx
msgid "Yes. Every feature is free: all {templates} templates, PDF and Word downloads, the ATS checker, cover letters and the job tracker. There are no ads, no tracking and no paid tier. Donations pay for hosting and development."
msgstr "Ha. Har bir xususiyat bepul: barcha {templates} andozalari, PDF va Word yuklab olishlar, ATS tekshiruvi, muqova xatlari va arizalar kuzatuvi. Hech qanday reklama, kuzatuv va pullik daraja yo'q. Xayriyalar hosting va rivojlanish uchun to'lanadi."

#: src/features/homepage/faq.tsx
msgid "Yes. Every job you track gets its own workspace: check your fit against the posting, draft answers from stories you wrote once, get a short plan before the interview, practice out loud with feedback and debrief afterwards. When offers arrive, compare them side by side. The coaching uses your own AI key; the comparison doesn’t need one."
msgstr "Ha. Siz kuzatadigan har bir ish o'z ish maydoniga ega bo'ladi: e'longa mosligingizni tekshiring, bir marta yozgan hikoyalaringizdan javoblar tuzing, intervyu oldidan qisqa reja oling, fikr-mulohaza bilan ovoz chiqarib mashq qiling va keyin tahlil qiling. Takliflar kelganda ularni yonma-yon solishtiring. Murabbiylik o'z AI kalitingizdan foydalanadi; solishtirish uchun kalit kerak emas."

#: src/features/homepage/faq.tsx
msgid "Yes. Import a PDF, a LinkedIn data export, a JSON Resume file or a Reactive Resume export, then pick up where it left off. With an AI provider set up, Word documents work too."
msgstr "Ha. PDF, LinkedIn maʼlumotlar eksporti, JSON Resume fayli yoki Reactive Resume eksportini import qiling, soʻngra toʻxtagan joydan davom eting. AI provayderi o'rnatilganda, Word hujjatlari ham ishlaydi."

#: src/features/homepage/faq.tsx
msgid "Yes. Reactive Resume is open source under the MIT License and ships as a Docker image, so it runs on your own server with your own database and storage."
msgstr "Ha. Reactive Resume MIT License ostida ochiq manba hisoblanadi va Docker tasviri sifatida jo‘natiladi, shuning uchun u o‘z serveringizda o‘z ma’lumotlar bazasi va xotirangiz bilan ishlaydi."

